# The fare rules as a pairwise model, for week 3.
#
# One booking: a lead passenger, whose age and residency vary, travelling
# with some other adults who are not Gozo residents, and perhaps a vehicle.
#
#   pict practicals/models/fares.pict
#
# Each line of the output after the header is one test case. Work out its
# expected price from the rules in practicals/week-03.md, never by running
# the code.

LeadAge:       infant, child, adult
LeadResident:  yes, no
OtherAdults:   0, 8, 9, 10
Vehicle:       yes, no

# Nobody books an infant to travel alone.
IF [LeadAge] = "infant" THEN [OtherAdults] > 0;
